## Aluminium
component-aluminium = Aluminium
    .genitive = aluminium
component-aluminium-description-novice = A light metal (almost three times lighter than steel) that conducts heat and electricity well. Used for pots, foil, wires.
component-aluminium-description-school = Aluminium conducts heat about 5 times better than steel, so an aluminium pot heats evenly. It melts at 660 °C.
